OL,3,CFood industry calls on Andy Burnham to
OL,4,Cmake food security a national priority
OL,6,FFood industry giants including Tesco
OL,7,Fand Danone have joined charities to
OL,8,Fcall on Andy Burnham to make food
OL,9,Fsecurity a national priority alongside
OL,10,Fenergy and defence.
OL,12,FThe letter, also signed by
OL,13,FSainsbury's, Aldi, Waitrose and Co-op,
OL,14,Fcharities including Barnardo's,
OL,15,FAmnesty International UK and WWF-UK,
OL,16,Fhealth campaigners, investment
OL,17,Fcompanies and farming organisations,
OL,18,Fwarns that the next "food shock" is
OL,19,F"not a question of if, but when".
OL,26,@zD@UOUzD@`O]{D@AOU{D@`O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/11
