PN,30302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785385067
OL,3,CFood industry calls on Andy Burnham to
OL,4,Cmake food security a national priority
OL,6,FIt says: "Each new shock lands on a
OL,7,Ffood system with less capacity to
OL,8,Fabsorb it. British production of fruit
OL,9,Fand vegetables has fallen 16% since
OL,10,F2015, and we now import 78% of our
OL,11,Fsupply.
OL,13,F"The next food shock is not a question
OL,14,Fof if, but when.
OL,26,@nD@JOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785385067
OL,3,CFood industry calls on Andy Burnham to
OL,4,Cmake food security a national priority
OL,6,F"To meet it prepared, food has to stop
OL,7,Fbeing an afterthought for the
OL,8,FGovernment: we need mechanisms to put
OL,9,Ffood high on the priority list of
OL,10,Fevery part of government, both
OL,11,Fnational and local, so that any
OL,12,Fdecisions that impact on health,
OL,13,Ffarming, planning, and trade secure
OL,14,Fbetter access to healthy and
OL,15,Fsustainable food for everyone."
OL,17,FIt goes on: "The cost of doing nothing
OL,18,Fon this issue is already falling on
OL,19,Fthose with the least resource, with
OL,20,Ffood insecurity already affecting 15%
OL,21,Fof households with children.
OL,26,@nD@AOUwD@_O]yD@MOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/11
