CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785385067
OL,3,CFood industry calls on Andy Burnham to
OL,4,Cmake food security a national priority
OL,6,F"Economic pressures continue to push a
OL,7,Fhealthy diet further out of reach for
OL,8,Fmany, with the NHS then left to pick
OL,9,Fup the bill."
OL,11,FIt calls on Mr Burnham to urgently
OL,12,Fintroduce a Good Food Bill to act as a
OL,13,Flegally binding framework to improve
OL,14,Fnational food and nutrition security,
OL,15,Fpublic health and food system
OL,16,Fresilience.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@MO]
