OL,3,CFood industry calls on Andy Burnham to
OL,4,Cmake food security a national priority
OL,6,FInternational conflict has pushed
OL,7,Ffertiliser costs up by around 40%
OL,8,Fsince last year, while more frequent
OL,9,Fextreme weather events, highlighted by
OL,10,Fthis summer's wildfires across Europe
OL,11,F` are making harvests vulnerable.
OL,13,FEarlier this year, the Government's
OL,14,Fown National Security Assessment
OL,15,Fconcluded that global biodiversity
OL,16,Floss poses a direct threat to the UK's
OL,17,Ffood supply.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/11
