OL,3,CFood industry calls on Andy Burnham to
OL,4,Cmake food security a national priority
OL,6,FUK food prices are on track to be 50%
OL,7,Fhigher by November compared to levels
OL,8,Fat the start of the cost-of-living
OL,9,Fcrisis in mid-2021, according to the
OL,10,FEnergy and Climate Intelligence Unit
OL,11,F(ECIU) think tank said.
OL,13,FCampaigners have warned that
OL,14,Fstruggling families will often turn to
OL,15,Fcheaper, less healthy food and cut
OL,16,Fdown on fruit and vegetables to cope
OL,17,Fwith rising costs.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
