PN,30307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785385067
OL,3,CFood industry calls on Andy Burnham to
OL,4,Cmake food security a national priority
OL,6,FThe letter states a Good Food Bill
OL,7,Fwould place food policy on a statutory
OL,8,Flong-term footing for the first time
OL,9,Fand should set legally binding targets
OL,10,Fto reduce childhood obesity, increase
OL,11,Fthe consumption of fruit and
OL,12,Fvegetables and the proportion grown in
OL,13,FBritain, and reduce household food
OL,14,Finsecurity.
OL,16,FSainsbury's chief executive Simon
OL,17,FRoberts said: "Recent weeks have shown
OL,18,Fjust how much pressure our food system
OL,19,Fis under.
OL,26,@yD@OOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/11
