PN,30308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785385067
OL,3,CFood industry calls on Andy Burnham to
OL,4,Cmake food security a national priority
OL,6,F"We need a more resilient food system
OL,7,Fthat attracts investment, backs
OL,8,FBritish farmers and helps keep
OL,9,Faffordable, nutritious food on tables
OL,10,Facross the nation.
OL,12,F"Food and farming should be at the
OL,13,Fheart of government policy, helping to
OL,14,Fbuild a stronger and more resilient
OL,15,Ffuture."
OL,17,FDanone vice president, general
OL,18,Fsecretary for North Europe Richard
OL,19,FHall said: "Poor diet, especially
OL,20,Famongst children, is one of the
OL,21,Fbiggest challenges facing the UK today.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUwD@HO]{D@LOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/11
