PN,30309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785385067
OL,3,CFood industry calls on Andy Burnham to
OL,4,Cmake food security a national priority
OL,6,F"Addressing it will require
OL,7,FGovernment, industry and civil society
OL,8,Fto work together on practical,
OL,9,Fevidence-based solutions.
OL,11,F"The Good Food Bill provides an
OL,12,Fimportant framework to improve public
OL,13,Fhealth while giving businesses the
OL,14,Flong-term certainty they need to
OL,15,Finvest and help deliver that change."
OL,17,FAnna Taylor, executive director of The
OL,18,FFood Foundation, said: "The UK food
OL,19,Fsystem is dangerously exposed to
OL,20,Fshocks far beyond our borders.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUwD@eO]zD@XOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/11
