CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785385067
OL,3,CFood industry calls on Andy Burnham to
OL,4,Cmake food security a national priority
OL,6,F"Over the last few years, we have seen
OL,7,Fthis play out through rising food
OL,8,Fprices and increasing diet and health
OL,9,Finequalities, with the price gap
OL,10,Fbetween healthy and less healthy food
OL,11,Fat the widest it's been for over a
OL,12,Fdecade.
OL,14,F"At the same time farmers are
OL,15,Fstruggling to make ends meet.
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOU
