OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1785385067
OL,3,CFood industry calls on Andy Burnham to
OL,4,Cmake food security a national priority
OL,6,F"What we need now is a Good Food Bill
OL,7,Fthat sets out a long-term framework
OL,8,Ffor building resilience in the UK food
OL,9,Fsystem ` one that holds successive
OL,10,Fgovernments to account and protects
OL,11,Fbusinesses, citizens and farmers
OL,12,Falike."
